{"parse": {"title": "跑者史诗-剧情", "pageid": 111054, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\"></span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">剧情</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E8.B7.91.E8.80.85.E5.8F.B2.E8.AF.97\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"跑者史诗\">跑者史诗</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 跑者史诗</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Epic of Runners</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item selected\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"1\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>Ⅰ</div></div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"2\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>Ⅱ</div></div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"3\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>Ⅲ</div></div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"4\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>Ⅳ</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"1\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_ye\"><img alt=\"1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_ye.png/600px-Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_ye.png/900px-Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_ye.png/1200px-Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>太阳早已收敛起光芒，人们仍不愿离去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"501402.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-501402.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-501402.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"501402.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-501402.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-501402.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-501402.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-501402.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">观众Ⅰ：</div><div>看到刚刚那次起跳了吗，比树梢高出了整整五英尺——这是我看过最棒的飞跃树梢比赛！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">观众Ⅱ：</div><div>得了吧，伙计，这是你看过的第一场神秘学竞赛。嘿，赛程表在你这儿吗，明天上午是——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">沙丝绒：</div><div>火中竞速四分之一决赛，记得早些到！赛程表弄丢的话，这儿还有的是！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>轮滑在沙地上一个轻盈的转弯，棕发姑娘稳稳地停下来，木盒的小食、汽水和传单一阵响动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/12/HeadIconSmall-505401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">观众Ⅱ：</div><div>谢谢你，小姐……哦，太好了，你这儿有汽水卖，麻烦给我来一瓶！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>零食、饮料和免费的观赛指南在一双双手中传递，沙丝绒在观众间灵巧地穿行。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307513.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4a/HeadIconSmall-307513.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307513.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307513.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4a/HeadIconSmall-307513.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307513.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4a/HeadIconSmall-307513.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307513.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">沙丝绒：</div><div>哈啊……又是忙碌的一天。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"502001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/HeadIconSmall-502001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-502001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"502001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/HeadIconSmall-502001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-502001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/HeadIconSmall-502001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-502001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">报童：</div><div>UTTU赛场特刊，小姐！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>孩子的声音清脆，近在咫尺。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">沙丝绒：</div><div>哇哦——你是什么时候到我身边的，我一点儿脚步声都没听见……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"502001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/HeadIconSmall-502001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-502001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"502001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/HeadIconSmall-502001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-502001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/HeadIconSmall-502001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-502001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">报童：</div><div>只是脚步更轻些，小姐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>报童把手中的杂志向上又托起几寸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"502001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/HeadIconSmall-502001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-502001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"502001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/HeadIconSmall-502001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-502001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/14/HeadIconSmall-502001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-502001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">报童：</div><div>来一份吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">沙丝绒：</div><div>你也是来做生意的吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">沙丝绒：</div><div>好吧……这也正常，我想半个爱丽丝泉的人都涌到这儿了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307513.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4a/HeadIconSmall-307513.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307513.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307513.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4a/HeadIconSmall-307513.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307513.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4a/HeadIconSmall-307513.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307513.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">沙丝绒：</div><div>让我看看，UTTU——等等，我肯定听说过这个名字。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>纸页翻动，当沙丝绒再一次抬起头来，孩子已经不见踪影。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">沙丝绒：</div><div>真奇怪，他甚至没收我的钱……这到底是什么东西……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307511.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5e/HeadIconSmall-307511.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307511.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307511.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5e/HeadIconSmall-307511.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307511.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5e/HeadIconSmall-307511.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307511.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">沙丝绒：</div><div>“跑者史诗”……这是体育杂志吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307311.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-307311.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307311.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307311.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-307311.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307311.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-307311.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307311.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>沙丝绒！快看这个！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一个孩子离去，两个孩子又回到她身边，一样举着那本封面火红的杂志。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>这是UTTU闪烁侧刊——乌卢鲁特别版！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>一个报童给了我和爱兹拉这个，这简直难以想象！我一直以为UTTU的邀请只是个传说，就像乌卢鲁运动会一样——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">沙丝绒：</div><div>等等……所以这东西很出名吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>当然了，这可是UTTU啊，你从来都没读过它吗……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">沙丝绒：</div><div>好吧，我来自富人区的、生活悠闲甚至可以接受专业体育训练的博学朋友，你得猜猜是谁穷到看报纸只看招募专栏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>呜……好吧，对不起……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>但……我也有好消息告诉你的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>你看这个。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307511.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5e/HeadIconSmall-307511.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307511.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307511.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5e/HeadIconSmall-307511.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307511.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5e/HeadIconSmall-307511.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307511.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">沙丝绒：</div><div>嗯？这小卡片是什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>这是名人卡，沙丝绒小姐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>它携带着某种情绪化的片刻，大多带有香气，少数可以发出声响。目前，UTTU闪烁集会是它唯一的出处。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>它在神秘学家……以及一部分人类中很受欢迎，狂热收集者总会为此一掷千金。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">沙丝绒：</div><div>啊，你是说……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>是的。沙丝绒小姐，这会是一个很棒的获益机会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>只要我们找到UTTU超级市场，我们一定能收获很多名人卡……嗯？沙丝绒小姐，你在做什么……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307515.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-307515.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307515.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307515.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-307515.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307515.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-307515.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307515.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">沙丝绒：</div><div>做什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>倒置的背包像是一面大张的嘴，我想我曾认识一个家伙就像如此。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>沙丝绒从背包深处掏出一管乳液护手霜，随意地丢在物品堆积的小山之巅。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">沙丝绒：</div><div>当然是清空背包，好狠狠地塞满那些金矿——我的意思是指——名人卡啦！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>其实……我想，你没必要把它们都丢在地上的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小姑娘嘟囔着，低头捡起小山中段的一枚锡纸包，她掂量两下，又拆开一个缝隙。就这样，她与可口的三明治打上了照面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">沙丝绒：</div><div>嘿，别小瞧我收集卡片的能力！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307310.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/23/HeadIconSmall-307310.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307310.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307310.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/23/HeadIconSmall-307310.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307310.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/23/HeadIconSmall-307310.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307310.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>不，当然不素啦……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>可燃点的两腮鼓鼓，重新抬起头。她拍拍胸口，顺利地咽下一大口三明治。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>我——我是说……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>如果你想找一个“够能装”的箱子，我们为什么不去找维尔汀呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/HeadIconSmall-307301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/HeadIconSmall-307301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/HeadIconSmall-307301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>她应该和和平乌鲁在一起，就在前面那个路牌左转的地方……</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"2\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_ye\"><img alt=\"1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_ye.png/600px-Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_ye.png/900px-Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_ye.png/1200px-Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307314.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/HeadIconSmall-307314.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307314.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307314.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/HeadIconSmall-307314.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307314.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/HeadIconSmall-307314.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307314.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>看哪——这本书上说，一万年前，人们游泳的图案便被画成岩画，留在了最干燥的沙漠洞窟里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>“因为那时，撒哈拉更加湿润，拥有更多绿洲与湖泊。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>早在沙漠还是湖泊的时候——听起来真是厉害极了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>可燃点兴奋地倒转书页，好让朋友们看清那些摆动手臂的小小人形。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>我想他们正在蛙泳……唔，好像又不太像……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">沙丝绒：</div><div>也许是自由泳，看，只要把手臂抬高一点——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>棕发姑娘伸开手臂，在空气中舒展，仿佛拨开一条不存在的波浪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">沙丝绒：</div><div>一模一样，不是吗——你说呢，维尔汀？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>恐怕游泳与考古都不是我的强项。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>而一如既往地，那位聪明、可靠的人类朋友及时给出了答案。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>有学者认为，游泳者洞窟的岩画证明了，爬泳——或者说自由泳的通用泳姿——是人类最早的游泳方式之一。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>因为爬泳结构合理，最为省力，能帮人们以更高效率捕鱼、或者躲过鳄鱼与河马的追击。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>爱兹拉的手指点向图片的另一角，游泳的人形身边，一只简笔河马正摇摇摆摆前进。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>游泳让人们的生活范围从陆地拓展到了水中，我想，一万年前的人们因此将它记录了下来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>哦……多好的话题，人与河马，人与自然，人与水——这令我想起了草原上的雨季。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>那总是一段美好的时光，暴雨倾盆，冲刷浮游的灰与干燥的热。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>哦……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>我本以为您不喜欢水，考虑到您在开幕式上的……意外。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>对那些装在管子里的水——那些你们所谓的自来水，我可确实没什么好感。但是雨水和雨季——它们带来生命与繁荣，就像火焰。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>我还记得那些时节，我看见孩子们走到水边，畏惧地探进手指与脚趾，然后他们大胆起来，同水波欢笑、嬉戏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>最终，他们学会怎么同泉眼、溪流与湖泊相处，怎样敬畏地、又勇敢地驾驭水流。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>人类用运动对抗自然。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>并理解自然。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>那是他们所要上的第一课，而后面，还有多得多的挑战等待着两足而立的孩子们。</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"3\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_ye\"><img alt=\"1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_ye.png/600px-Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_ye.png/900px-Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_ye.png/1200px-Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">沙丝绒：</div><div>好吧，我们读到这儿了——让所有人都疯狂的小球。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">沙丝绒：</div><div>我是说，篮球、网球、橄榄球……每一种弹来弹去的，让醉鬼们通宵欢呼或痛哭流涕的——球体。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>球类……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>也有人与我谈过关于球类运动的话题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>沙丝绒灵巧地屈指记数，声音轻快。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">沙丝绒：</div><div>当然了，这可是现存最热门的运动之一——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">沙丝绒：</div><div>谁都喜欢球，足球、篮球、羽毛球，一颗小小或大大的圆球，能够抛起，也能够飞下，它的确很迷人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">沙丝绒：</div><div>人们情愿掏出钞票，脸上涂着当代的战争油彩，涌进球场或酒吧挤上几个小时，就为了看——或者亲自让一颗球满场乱飞。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>你也在那之中吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">沙丝绒：</div><div>我啊——我嘛！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>沙丝绒活动了一下身体，偏过头，想起不算遥远的过去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">沙丝绒：</div><div>我对它不迷恋，也不厌恶，我们只是配合。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">沙丝绒：</div><div>棒球、橄榄球，或是别的什么都行——我只是想拿点儿奖金。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">沙丝绒：</div><div>和圆球相处很容易，但作为万能临时替补，和人相处就不是那么容易了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>你的队员不信任你？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">沙丝绒：</div><div>一部分是，很少有人会信任和接纳前一天还站在对面队伍里的家伙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">沙丝绒：</div><div>但球归根结底是一种配合游戏，我们这样很难赢，我也就很难得到更好的佣金——很快的，球队不再愿意联系我，我就此失去了这条财路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>也许在对抗运动中，这是在所难免的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">沙丝绒：</div><div>没错，你看——“许多运动都来源于战斗与防御的预演……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>书页在指间发出沙沙声，沙丝绒攥着它，但不急于翻过下一页。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-307501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-307501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-307501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">沙丝绒：</div><div>“在对抗自己、对抗自然之后，团体运动开始出现……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">沙丝绒：</div><div>人们终于发明出了对抗彼此的手段，不是吗？用这些小小的、万众瞩目的圆球。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">沙丝绒：</div><div>但比起真的自相残杀，互相手持石子儿瞄准对方的脑袋——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">沙丝绒：</div><div>这是一个开始，就像是球，我们终于意识到了世界上还有一个“对方”，有一个推出去，便能抛回来的反作用力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>手臂举起，前伸，转动手腕，如此轻盈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-307501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-307501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-307501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">沙丝绒：</div><div>抛球——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"307513.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4a/HeadIconSmall-307513.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-307513.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"307513.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4a/HeadIconSmall-307513.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-307513.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4a/HeadIconSmall-307513.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-307513.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">沙丝绒：</div><div>然后接球。</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"4\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_ye\"><img alt=\"1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_ye.png/600px-Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_ye.png/900px-Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_ye.png/1200px-Cg-1_5_bg_yundongchangxiujianhou_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>红土地已然入夜，而火焰依旧明亮，为阅读者们映照着书页。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>……战争。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">和平乌鲁：</div><div>掌握力量，意识到拥有何等力量的人，总会走上这样的路途。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>因为想法不同，分歧而后的自然的结果总是斗争。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>但我想这也不是永远的，这不会是最终的结局。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>低下头，年轻的研究员踟蹰片刻。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>就像是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>就像是乌卢鲁运动场。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不好说出口的话，自然有人能说出口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>可燃点向后仰倒，靠在一块巨石旁。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>如果真要追溯历史的话，我们所经历的远不是它第一次失踪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>传说，在彩蜥为红土上的人们带来“这处适合奔跑的热土”之后，相聚在此处的部族越来越多，最终，他们之中爆发了斗争。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>这是乌卢鲁运动场的第一次失踪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>第二次听说是在中世纪，为了一颗坠落的星星，两个国家在这片土地上开战，敌人的敌人，朋友的朋友，最终都被红沙地吞噬。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>这是乌卢鲁运动场的第二次失踪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>也就是说……我们找到的乌卢鲁运动场还会再次消失吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>也许会吧——未来的事情，我也不知道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>但我并不担心它。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>它总会被再一次找到的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小姑娘揽着自己的朋友，眯眯眼睛笑起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>我们不也吵过架的吗，终归，大家都会和好的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>……啊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>恍惚的一瞬，书页上的战争才刚兴起，剑拔弩张地向更前方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>我想……这些矛盾是不会消失的，那些真实的战争也是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>善良的孩子喃喃着，翻动手下的纸张。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>人们会陷入痛苦，会互相仇视，那些“问题”是横亘在面前的山，它们是错误的道路，可……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>可一旦踏入其中，便会被其裹挟，难以抽离。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>伤口被造成了，伤口就会作为伤口存在，所以我们应该避免的是……争端，我们应该追求的是……和平的世界，对吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小理想主义者的嘴唇嗫嚅。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>我觉得有点难。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>可燃点调整了一下姿势，将头凑近爱兹拉膝盖上的书本。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>该怎么说呢……袋鼠有袋鼠的跳动方式，而鱼儿有鱼儿的泳姿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>伤口作为伤口存在，伤口自然也会作为伤口愈合。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一页，又一页，像是为了印证自己的话一样，小姑娘在书页中寻找着结局。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>回忆中的过去——我是说，我的“原始人”生活教会了我一个道理——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>世界上没有永远旺盛的火，它会有虚弱的时候，也会有将熄的时候……最重要的是，我们得保留火种。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">可燃点：</div><div>啊——你看！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>书页上的图画清晰可见。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>这是，本耶普变成的石碑……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那是，一颗赤红的星点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一个微不足道的证明。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>证明这地上的极与极之间仍可连接，证明无法相融的油与水亦可以“爱”弥合。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">爱兹拉：</div><div>……这就是，我们留下的火种呀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一点细微的意识，一次回头的机会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这正是和平宝贵的开始。</div></div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "跑者史诗-剧情"}}